cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ChemoTreeVsDL with PrimeNet (TimeBERT) for MIMIC-IV neutropenic fever and aplasia"
abstract: >-
  Fork of the ChemoTree / FLabBench pipeline (bionetslab/ChemoTreeVsDL) with a
  native PrimeNet/TimeBERT integration and STraTS Fig. 5-style pretrain–finetune
  orchestration for chemotherapy side-effect prediction from irregular laboratory
  time series on MIMIC-IV.
